# kscreen's choices for an app that draws.

menu "kscreen"

    config KSCREEN_ROTATE_PAD
        bool "The pad turns with the glass"
        default y
        help
            When an app turns its glass with kscreen_set_rotation(), the four
            pad buttons publish the direction they point on the turned glass:
            at 270 degrees, the pad's right reads as up. TOP and BOT are side
            buttons and never turn. Off, the app gets the buttons as wired
            whatever the glass shows, and maps them itself.

endmenu
